#11201
"Narrow Canyon Trail"
"The trail continues to cut a north-south course through the cliff.  The sides
of the canyon at this point are their highest, rising far above the ground.
At this point the passage widens slightly, and becomes more uneven as the
newly uncovered path meets the pre-existing one.  The continuation of the
trail to the north slopes downward somewhat, and trees can be glimpsed in the
distance.
"
"*H
