#11203
"Wilderness Fringe"
"This band of scrubland cuts between the cliffs and pass to the south, and a
forested area to the northwest.  The ground here is covered with twisted
bushes and stunted trees, with their roots entwined with what appears to be
ancient cobblestones and broken fragments of flagstone.  To the north a road
can be vaguely discerned, albeit broken and long unused.  In the hills
eastward, shells of abandoned buildings are scattered, appearing as abandoned
as the wastelands in which you stand.
"
"*H
"
